{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477080/extras/e0a46fe701236440b3b34346ab343e29.avif?t=1769006774\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Own it. Command it. Make a profit.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In AutoParts Simulator, you are the owner of an auto parts store and you need to turn it into a successful business. Negotiate with demanding customers, manage an ever-changing inventory, adjust your prices and expand your store intelligently.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every decision directly influences your profits, reputation and customer loyalty. Will you choose an honest and efficient path? Or maximize profits at any cost?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Key Features:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83e\uddfe Complete store simulation: control inventory, prices, taxes, service and profits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\uded2 Customers with unique personalities: each with their own expectations, budget and negotiation style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udfec Store expansion: buy new shelves, increase space and add new departments.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udcc8 Dynamic economy: prices go up and down according to the market and your decisions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udd27 Realistic parts: Hundreds of automotive parts categorized with different qualities, brands and uses.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udfaf Career mode: Face challenges such as economic crises, aggressive competition and difficult customers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get ready for a challenging and engaging business management experience. Your success depends on strategy, persuasion and a keen eye for opportunities!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning of a Dream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/f6d8f2c82dbe3f326f5d4ee479bd9c621917b2c4.jpg"},{"name":"He's watching me pass by here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/37a3b5d29d053a368c46d59367b4a0c0a2931ec3.jpg"},{"name":"Money, Money, Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/056ffb6a33b886a256793806b25386e906a8bff9.jpg"},{"name":"Many bills to pay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/b6ffa1d5b0a011b454920da4b2f83f3a1ba7f2c1.jpg"},{"name":"Full Cart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/943a54b18d126d49f0284ddfc34aef36a0e99bdf.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Client","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/4249cab4c19f305e94cbf83fa031479bb9c7edf1.jpg"},{"name":"First Brick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/a1c082cd38d8b3c002aae2abee62bf3e1d3e3cd6.jpg"},{"name":"New Horizons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/2396ff8bb51a86848f8550b6dba5aa58c4bb716e.jpg"},{"name":"I can already pay the rent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1477080/1cc9dd237371459e9044c59daf20358948b47c2f.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1477080?t=1769006774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477080/309290cedff9d2c111525aa9acad77e01faf2c87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769006774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477080/811375afebb3218f9944306201ced10